**Task Model**

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** |
|----------|----------|--------------|--------------|----------------------|
| **AT1: Compute Waiting Times** | Calculate waiting time for each storage location. | AND | storage | 1 |
| **AT2: Compute Path Lengths** | Compute path length from robot to each storage. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT3: Generate Collection Order** | Generate order of storages based on computed waiting times and path lengths. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT4: Send Request Message** | Send request message to storage specifying required resources. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT5: Wait for Retrieval Confirmation** | Wait until storage confirms retrieval of resources. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT6: Navigate to Storage** | Navigate robot to the storage location. | AND | storage | 1 |
| **AT7: Pick Up Resources** | Pick up the requested resources at storage. | AND | storage | 1 |
| **AT8: Calculate Shortest Path to Destination** | Calculate shortest path from current location to destination. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT9: Plan Multiple Runs** | Plan multiple runs if capacity constraints require. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT10: Navigate to Destination** | Navigate robot to destination location. | AND | destination | 1 |
| **AT11: Monitor Battery** | Monitor battery level during navigation. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT12: Return to Checkpoint** | Return resource to checkpoint if battery low during delivery. | AND | checkpoint | 1 |
| **AT13: Assign Remaining Delivery** | Assign remaining delivery tasks to another robot. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT15: Deposit Resources** | Deposit resources at destination. | AND | destination | 1 |
| **AT16: Monitor Battery Level (Collection)** | Monitor battery level during collection phase. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT17: Monitor Battery Level (Delivery)** | Monitor battery level during delivery phase. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT18: Return to Recharge** | Return robot to recharge station when battery ≤ 10 % during collection. | AND | recharge station | 1 |
| **AT19: Return to Checkpoint (Delivery)** | Return resource to checkpoint when battery ≤ 30 % during delivery. | AND | checkpoint | 1 |
| **AT20: Trigger Alert** | Trigger alert if failure to return resource to checkpoint. | AND | robot | 1 |
| **AT21: Send Report** | Send report of failure to sector manager. | AND | sector manager | 1 |

